{"ID":"20230925154241-imcp39g","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230925154241-imcp39g","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154241-imcp39g\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154245-8ju40ci\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154245-24bbvll\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154245-24bbvll\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:25,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:25\u0026#125;","title":"【柏叶汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230925154245"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230925154245-8ju40ci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154245-8ju40ci","updated":"20230925154245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：柏叶三两、干姜三两、艾叶三把"}]},{"ID":"20230925154245-cxxbm2w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154245-cxxbm2w","updated":"20230925154245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右三味，以水五升，取马通汁（马尿，找不到或用童子尿60cc）一升，合煮，取一升，分温再服。"}]},{"ID":"20230925154245-24bbvll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154245-24bbvll","updated":"20230925154245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【15.4】吐血不止者，柏叶汤主之；黄土汤亦主之。"}]}]}